<title>USA: Imperial Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Imperial Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>					  1997			  1996</p>
<p> Net sales		     $3,703,000		  $3,283,000</p>
<p> Net income			 139,000		     123,000</p>
<p>Less:  Dividends on</p>
<p> redeemable preferred stock  (83,000)		    (83,000)</p>
<p>Net income applicable to common</p>
<p> stockholders			56,000			40,000</p>
<p>Net income per share of common</p>
<p> stock				   0.01			  0.01</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares and</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>   outstanding		  5,873,701		   5,387,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income per share of common stock gives effect to $83,000 of cumulative preferred dividends not declared for each of the first quarters of 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
</text>
